{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "713998f40ff218fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Afterward, as the sun was about to set, I looked and saw a herd of antelopes coming from a distance, with that brother among them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "85549f417e0368b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he came close to me, he was naked. His hair covered his private parts and served as clothing to cover him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "e0ccd0b2d8fbb9dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he reached me, he became very afraid, thinking that I was a spirit. He stood still and prayed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "adf652b1a05cd12f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For many spirits had tempted him, as he told me afterward."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "594867c6077d691e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When I realized that he was afraid, I walked toward him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "1ebda17f74e0bec5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I asked him, “How did you come to this place? How long has it been since you came here? What did you used to eat? And why are you naked, with no clothing on you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "7da7eaef08963980",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When we became comfortable with each other, we ate bread together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "548264b184493588",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“My hair grew, and my clothes wore out completely.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "304283a7c4928451",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I asked him, “Then how much did you suffer when you first came to this place?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "d750cc91ebea4ab0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“From that day onward, all my internal organs became healthy, and I stopped suffering from a liver disease."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "e62a15fa3d4a95f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I live in this deserted place without hardship.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0090",
      "source_sha256": "52abf4e1f0e013d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“I too am a monk like you, living in this desert because of my sins.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.000.0095",
      "source_sha256": "750c40d27e557a5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The name of that plant is Erete."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.001.0017",
      "source_sha256": "fa13eef7dd22a276",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God gives to each person according to the hardship that he will endure."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.001.0060",
      "source_sha256": "e899a3bdae055110",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He also made the other plants growing on the mountain taste sweet in my mouth, like honey."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.001.0063",
      "source_sha256": "5be62ea3d772af11",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he said in the holy Gospel, “Do not worry about what you will eat, what you will drink, or what you will wear. Your Father in heaven knows what you need before you ask him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0003",
      "source_sha256": "dc27eb5bdaa93bee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when the sun was about to set, I looked"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0004",
      "source_sha256": "a8035cc5dc845a02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and saw a loaf of bread lying there, along with a vessel of water."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0005",
      "source_sha256": "5845cff0b2064b89",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “Get up, my brother, and eat, and drink this little water, for I see that you are in danger from hunger, thirst, and the hardships of the journey.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0006",
      "source_sha256": "35374a4ed26dba1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I said to him, “As God Almighty lives, I will neither eat nor drink until we recline and eat together.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0007",
      "source_sha256": "b970c992f9de89e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After I kept insisting, we finally reclined together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0011",
      "source_sha256": "f29e65e09240fc4a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We also both drank from the vessel of water."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0021",
      "source_sha256": "945a12a7c23e5923",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me again, “When you go to Egypt, tell others about me as an encouragement to the brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0032",
      "source_sha256": "e2821dc6f1f1a36e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For you were not appointed to this service by people. Rather, the Lord appointed you to comfort the holy brothers who live in the desert, so that you might tell about them and their encouragement among the brothers who serve God, for the benefit of those who hear.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0034",
      "source_sha256": "9589c73d19028786",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Immediately I fell down on the ground."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0056",
      "source_sha256": "44fb761c4198ce47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "When we had spent some time talking with one another,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.002.0066",
      "source_sha256": "e43c7656a0daa8fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "and we never knew where they had come from, but we would come in and find them lying there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_onnophrius#CopScr.life-onnophrius.003.0042",
      "source_sha256": "890588a43fecfb61",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "Immediately I became sober, like those who are drunk on wine."
    }
  ]
}
